Captured from MySQL 8.0.46 and 8.4.11 Docker images, which return the same output, with schema `shop` selected:

```
CREATE VIEW v_order_counts AS SELECT customer_id, COUNT(*) AS n FROM orders GROUP BY customer_id;
EXPLAIN FORMAT=JSON SELECT v.customer_id, v.n FROM v_order_counts v WHERE v.n > 1;
SHOW WARNINGS;
```
